    narr:narration """On 2026-07-29 this position records a ratified adoption decision rather than an argument for one. QuintonFairweather voices the commitment directly — [adopting Zypherion for the analytics pipeline](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1) and [scheduling migration next quarter](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3) — both stamped as decision-level conviction, calm-positive affect, and legitimate power. XenaExpertgh then consolidates the same decisions into a structured summary, opening with [\"Key decisions:\"](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4) and listing the database choice and timeline in parallel form — [database](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_5) and [timeline](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_7) — carrying informational power and matter-of-fact register. The style-lanes aggregate to parallelism, short-punchy-cadence, and rule-of-three across three observations, all in the org lane. Every child carries conviction as \"decision,\" and no child argues, evaluates alternatives, or hedges; the trajectory is a single ratification event voiced by two actors in complementary roles — one authoritative, one consolidating.""" ;
